MUTATION 1 is an EQUIVALENT MUTANT, not a test gap: with the
WHERE gl_accounts.imported_from = EXCLUDED.imported_from guard in place the
DO UPDATE only ever fires on rows whose tag already equals EXCLUDED's, so
re-adding the assignment writes the value it already holds. Mutation 2
removes that guard and kills 2 tests.

